    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You [[/act perform]] a final goodbye before attempting to overload a spell with magic from your spotlight. Attempt to counteract a single spell or magical effect on a target with your spotlight. Your counteract rank for this attempt is equal to half your level rounded up, and you use the result of your Perform for the counteract check. Whether or not you succeed, your spotlight ends and the target becomes temporarily immune to Cut the Signal for 10 minutes.</p>",
